H2O, LDA: Car-Parrinello MD after quenching the wavefunction to the BO surface

&CPMD
 MOLECULAR DYNAMICS CP
 QUENCH BO
 CONVERGENCE ORBITALS
  1.0d-6
 MAXSTEP
  20
 TIMESTEP
  4.0
 EMASS
  400.0
&END
&SYSTEM
 SYMMETRY
  1
 ANGSTROM
 CELL
  7.0 1.0 1.0 0.0 0.0 0.0
 CUTOFF
  50.0
&END
&DFT
 FUNCTIONAL LDA
&END
&ATOMS
*O_GO.psp
 LMAX=P
  1
  0.0000  0.0000  0.1173
*H_GO.psp
 LMAX=S
  2
  0.0000  0.8172 -0.4992
  0.0000 -0.7572 -0.4692
&END
